 "//": "Story Phase 12 in the galley, the morning after. The gear: Jim's bucket (3,6), the rope coil by the Frog Grog cask (15,9). The ransack (118): the drawers (prep table), the beans (the stores), the long table, the crate; Bob's die. The Grand Dice on the long table (8,7) with its six siblings in their crate by the ladder (16,5). The hops (122): the floor by the hammock (10,9), by the stove (3,5), under the long table's edge (8,8), where it stays on three. The regalia laid aside on the bench end (9,8); the sash on the long table until it goes to the wardrobe. Breakfast at the stove, the prep table and the long table. The finger: Garrick goes from Pete to Bob to Gristle to Jim to Rusty Tom (who runs for the bow).",
